      "question": "<figure class=\"practice-figure\" style=\"max-width:150mm;margin:2mm auto\"><img src=\"resources/exams/edexcel-8ma0-22-2024-june/q01-figure.svg\" alt=\"Figure 1. The car speed-time graph from 0 to 30 seconds.\"></figure><p>Figure 1 shows the speed-time graph for the journey of a car moving in a long queue of traffic on a straight horizontal road.</p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t = 0\"></span>, the car is at rest at the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span>.</p><p>The car then accelerates uniformly for 5 seconds until it reaches a speed of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5 \\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p><p>For the next 15 seconds the car travels at a constant speed of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5 \\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p><p>The car then decelerates uniformly until it comes to rest at the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span>.</p><p>The total journey time is 30 seconds.</p><p>(a) Find the distance <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"AB\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>(b) Sketch a distance-time graph for the journey of the car from <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
